monitor/watcher/test-spawn-worker-resume.sh#1	command	n/a	sendkeys	not-a-spawn	assert_contains needle.
monitor/watcher/test-spawn-worker-resume.sh#2	bare	n/a	sendkeys	not-a-spawn	assert_contains needle.
