monitor/watcher/test-spawn-shape-manifest.sh#1	bare	shell	no-sendkeys	fixture-other	Not a spawn at all: the literal text of the FIXTURE this suite plants for its own #1483 positive control, inside a printf that writes a throwaway file into a scratch git repo. It never executes, and the classifier is right to see it -- the token is in the source. Classified rather than exempted because an allowlist keyed on this file's NAME would be a hole shaped like whoever wrote it.
